 "readme": "README.md",
 "readme_first_paragraph": "MeshVault Bot is a self-hostable bot application for people who want AI bots that each keep their own thread, memory, routines, and computer. The computer is a Docker container by default or an E2B sandbox. It ships web, Electron desktop, and Expo iOS clients. It is in beta and aimed at developers who run it themselves.",
